Terminal emulation is provided by libghostty-vt from Ghostty
(https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty, MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 Mitchell Hashimoto, Ghostty
contributors), built and linked through the libghostty-vt crate
(https://github.com/Uzaaft/libghostty-rs, MIT OR Apache-2.0). Neither is included in this
repository; Cargo fetches them at build time.

lazierdocker's feature set is modelled on lazydocker (https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazydocker,
MIT) and its terminal interaction model on herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr, Apache-2.0); no
source code from either project is included.
